# Scratch measurement generators. The captures they emit (*.txt) are the deliverable;
# the generators stay on disk untracked so the lane stays clean (same rule as stas-394-evidence).
raw/*.py
raw/__pycache__/
raw/.*
raw/*.log
*.log
# The engine-side delivery artifacts travel as attachments on the card, not as content in this
# repository: the delivered branch lives in the engine repository and this repository carries no
# engine source. Their sha256, head and prerequisite are printed in window-announcement.txt.
stas-395-delivery.bundle
stas-395-delivery.bundle.b64
stas-395-delivery.patch
stas-395-delivery.bundle.b64.txt
stas-395-delivery.patch.txt
